## Scope retained

This is a forward source theorem for an actual supplied graph, calendar, rate bank, mode assignment and typed OriginalSpan, together with the stated entrance/natural averaging and forest observation consequences. It does not recover a chronological prefix from endpoint data, turn an internal cut into an admitted observation, identify hidden source provenance, prove full G4 finite forcing, or complete general G3/G6/G7. A larger connected union containing these two additions requires its own aggregate and audit.
